WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.800
This is a public service announcement sponsored by Just Blaze and the good folks at Rocketsville Records.

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:18.320
Fellow Americans, it is with the utmost pride and sincerity that I present this recording as a living testament and recollection of history in the making during our generation.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:24.400
Allow me to reintroduce myself. My name is Ho, H to the O, V.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.880
I used to move snowflakes by the O, Z. I guess even back then you can call me.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.500
CEO of the ROC, ho

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.720
Fresh out the frying pan, into the fire

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.480
I'll be the music man's number one supplier

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.180
Flyer than a piece of paper, bear my name

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.800
Got the hottest chick in the game, wear my chain

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.380
That's right, ho, ho
